  - m_Id: 37093555926757376
    m_Localized: "An unknown peerless master, whose very name has been lost to history,
      created this Divine Art by taking the beauty of blooming peach blossoms and
      the eternity that never fades as the foundation of its martial principles.\n\nNothing
      is known of the creator\u2014not their deeds, nor even the sect to which they
      belonged. With no successor to inherit it, the art vanished into the history
      of the Jianghu.\n\nThe Internal Energy cultivated through the Peach Blossom
      Art is exceptionally pure, flowing effortlessly through the meridians without
      obstruction.\n\nIts true strength does not lie in overwhelming power or immense
      Internal Energy. Like countless peach blossoms blooming as one, its Qi rejects
      nothing, embracing any energy until all are harmonized into a single flow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
